silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_03_quality_leg_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'QualityLegYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Quality Leg', the quality_leg_arrow is BodyMassQuality -> MittensColimitApex: the body-mass quality attribute leg; it is monic but not epic; it does not identify the quality with Mittens.; also, In 'Quality Leg', the pato_type_arrow records that BodyMassQuality is typed under PATO:0000128 (mass quality); the PATO authority is shared across many quality instances, so this arrow is not monic." .
